---
kind: scene
id: hub.returnDied
title: Hauled up again
pov: ilo
on: hubVisit
priority: 10
when: "@died"
---

## Rail

::bg{location="deck" time="night"}
@narrator: The line goes slack, then heavy. They haul him up hand over hand.

<match on="run.killedBy">
  <when is="eel">
    @narrator: There are tooth-marks in his diving leathers, a hand's width apart.
  </when>
  <when is="choir">
    @narrator: He comes up humming a song none of them taught him, and cannot stop.
  </when>
  <when is="archivist">
    @narrator: His hands are black with ink to the wrist. None of it will wash off.
  </when>
  <when is="regent">
    @narrator: His lips are blue and his eyes are open. Something sat on a throne and looked at him.
  </when>
  <when is="pressure">
    @narrator: He went too deep, too fast. His ears are bleeding.
  </when>
  <when is="unset">
    @narrator: Nobody can say what took him this time.
  </when>
</match>

@tavi{when="quest.eelBounty.failedBy == 'until'"}: No eel, then. The pot stays on anyway.

<match on="user.deaths">
  <when is="..1">
    @brann: Again. You died again, and you came back again.
  </when>
  <when is="2..4">
    @brann: That's the {{user.deaths:ordinalWord}} time I've pulled a corpse out of the sea and had it thank me.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @brann{emotion="wry"}: I've stopped counting, boy. The sea hasn't.
  </otherwise>
</match>
